# The historical P/E datasets record the byte count and SHA-256 of their own
# data files, and the production loader derives input_set_id from the same
# bytes. A checkout that rewrites line endings would change those digests, so
# a digest recorded on one platform would not match the same commit checked
# out on another. Force LF for the dataset directory so the working tree, the
# git blob and every checkout platform agree byte for byte.
data/historical_pe/**/*.json text eol=lf
